he first of isbn, iris-handle, doi, issn, url builds the IRI, so an edition change is a new publication. issued and modified are Dublin Core. reviewBy is the handbook's review-by date (§12.5.1). sha256 pins the PDF. Derives from DublinCore (smart-base input/fsh/models/DublinCore.fsh); title, creator, publisher, language, rights are its elements. Class IRI: http://smart.who.int/kg/publication.\">KGPublication</a><a name=\"es-KGPublication\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"opacity: 0.50\">0</span><span style=\"opacity: 0.50\">..</span><span style=\"opacity: 0.50\">*</span></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\">DublinCore</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Knowledge graph L1: Publication<br/><br/>Elements defined in Ancestors:<a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"A name given to the resource\">title</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"An entity responsible for making the resource\">creator</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"The topic of the resource\">subject</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"An account of the resource\">description</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"An entity responsible for making the resource available\">publisher</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"An entity responsible for making contributions to the resource\">contributor</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"A point or period of time associated with an event in the lifecycle of the resource\">date</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"The nature or genre of the resource\">type</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"The file format, physical medium, or dimensions of the resource\">format</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"An unambiguous reference to the resource within a given context\">identifier</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"A related resource from which the described resource is derived\">source</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"A language of the resource\">language</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"A related resource\">relation</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"The spatial or temporal topic of the resource\">coverage</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DublinCore.html\" title=\"Information about rights held in and over the resource\">rights</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\